          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 78058,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo un nuovo concetto che spiega come le variabili tengono traccia di operazioni come aggiungere o rimuovere dollari da un portafoglio.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: darkBlue;&#xA;    /* Green */&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Wallet: &lt;strong&gt;$&lt;span id=&quot;amount&quot;&gt;15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;add()&quot;&gt;Add $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;remove()&quot;&gt;Remove $1&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let wallet = 15;&#xA;   let amountCounter = document.getElementById('amount');&#xA;   &#xA;   function add() {&#xA;    wallet += 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function remove() {&#xA;    wallet -= 1;&#xA;    amountCounter.innerHTML = wallet;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 78057,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo una variabile, le <strong>assegniamo</strong> un valore, come assegnare <code>3</code> a <code>wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando creiamo una variabile, le <strong>assegniamo</strong> un valore. Assegna un valore a <code>wallet</code> in modo che il codice stampi <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 78056,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>L'autoassegnazione</strong> si verifica quando assegniamo a una variabile il proprio valore. Ad esempio, possiamo impostare <code>wallet</code> sul valore <code>3</code> con <code>wallet = wallet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>wallet</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>wallet</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>L'autoassegnazione</strong> assegna a una variabile il proprio valore. Crea la seconda riga affinché <code>wallet</code> mantenga il valore e stampi <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"wallet\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>wallet</code> e infine <code>wallet</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 78055,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché possiamo riassegnare le variabili a se stesse, possiamo aumentare o diminuire le variabili impostate su numeri. Prova ad aumentare <code>wallet</code> con <code>wallet = wallet + 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3 + 1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>wallet + 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'autoassegnazione ci permette di modificare un numero. Aumenta <code>wallet</code> di uno in modo che il codice stampi <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"wallet - 1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"wallet + 3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>wallet + 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 78053,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili autoassegnate ci permettono di tenere traccia dei dati che cambiano nel tempo. Ad esempio, un utente potrebbe aggiungere <code>2</code> dollari a un portafoglio e poi rimuoverne <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>2</code>, seguito da <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'autoassegnazione permette di seguire un valore che cambia. Partendo da <code>3</code>, aggiungi <code>2</code> e poi sottrai <code>1</code>, in modo che il codice stampi <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"wallet = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet = wallet - \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(wallet)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>+</code>, seguito da <code>-</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 78054,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le variabili impostate su stringhe funzionano allo stesso modo. Prova a impostare <code>name</code> su <code>name + \" John\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Account name: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Elton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Account name:  Elton John\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Assigning a value",
            "id": 78052,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore assegna questo codice alla variabile <code>speed</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una condizione successiva verifica <code>speed == 0</code>. In base a questa assegnazione, che cosa restituisce il confronto?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>True</code>, perché <code>speed</code> memorizza <code>0</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>False</code>, perché <code>speed</code> memorizza il proprio nome.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Un errore, perché <code>0</code> non può essere assegnato a una variabile.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>True</code>, perché <code>speed</code> memorizza <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning a value",
            "id": 78051,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>5</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza ancora <code>100</code> dopo la seconda assegnazione?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"100\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">La seconda assegnazione memorizza di nuovo in <code>speed</code> il valore attuale di <code>speed</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Assegnare una variabile a se stessa la reimposta sul primo valore.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Python ignora ogni assegnazione che usa la stessa variabile su entrambi i lati.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">La seconda assegnazione memorizza di nuovo in <code>speed</code> il valore attuale di <code>speed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 78050,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?  </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>101</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>100</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>101</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In che modo la seconda riga fa visualizzare <code>101</code> alla console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed = speed + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"101\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Legge <code>100</code>, aggiunge <code>1</code> e memorizza <code>101</code> in <code>speed</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Unisce le cifre <code>100</code> e <code>1</code>, quindi memorizza <code>1001</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Calcola <code>101</code> ma lascia <code>100</code> memorizzato in <code>speed</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Legge <code>100</code>, aggiunge <code>1</code> e memorizza <code>101</code> in <code>speed</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Why self-assigning matters",
            "id": 78063,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché l'autoassegnazione è un concetto di programmazione così potente?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Perché ci permette di tenere traccia dei dati che cambiano nel tempo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Perché ci aiuta a creare confronti</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché ci permette di tenere traccia dei dati che cambiano nel tempo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'autoassegnazione è potente perché permette di tenere traccia dei dati che cambiano nel tempo.</p><p>Un gioco aggiunge <code>points</code> allo <code>score</code> attuale dopo ogni turno. Quale riga tiene traccia del nuovo totale?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>score = score + points</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>score == score + points</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>score = points</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>score = score + points</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Self-assigning strings",
            "id": 78049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joanne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Rowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Joanne Rowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Joanne Rowling</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Rowling Joanne</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Joanne Rowling</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>Joanne Rowling</code> invece di <code>Rowling Joanne</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joanne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; Rowling&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(name)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Joanne Rowling\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il nome attuale è a sinistra di <code>+</code>, quindi il nuovo testo viene aggiunto dopo.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L’assegnazione sostituisce il vecchio nome prima di unire le due stringhe.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">L'autoassegnazione sposta automaticamente il nuovo testo alla fine, indipendentemente dall'ordine degli operandi.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il nome attuale è a sinistra di <code>+</code>, quindi il nuovo testo viene aggiunto dopo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
