          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 78221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sappiamo che possiamo aggiungere <code>1</code> a una variabile scrivendo il nome della variabile. In questo caso, aggiungiamone uno a <code>likes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes = likes + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(likes)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>likes</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "+= operator",
            "id": 78240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece di riscrivere il nome della variabile, possiamo usare l'operatore <code>+=</code> per aggiungere un numero con <code>sales += 1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sales = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sales += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sales)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sales</code>, seguito da <code>+=</code> e infine <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece di riscrivere il nome della variabile, l'operatore <code>+=</code> aggiunge un numero in un solo passaggio. Usalo in modo che il codice stampi <code>6</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sales = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sales += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sales)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>sales</code>, seguito da <code>+=</code> e infine <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "-= operator",
            "id": 78232,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per sottrarre dal valore di una variabile, usiamo l'operatore <code>-=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"sales = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"sales -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(sales)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>-=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: += operator",
            "id": 78220,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa mostra questo codice nella console? </p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale assegnazione più lunga aggiornerebbe <code>marbles</code> come la seconda riga?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(marbles)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>marbles = marbles + 2</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>marbles = 2</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>marbles = marbles - 2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>marbles = marbles + 2</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
