            "title": "Question: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 78215,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>199</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>199</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed -= \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(speed)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>speed -= 1</code> sottrae <code>1</code> da <code>200</code> e memorizza il risultato.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed -= 1</code> aggiunge 1 a 200 e salva 201.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>speed -= 1</code> sostituisce 200 con 1.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>speed -= 1</code> sottrae <code>1</code> da <code>200</code> e memorizza il risultato.</p></body></html>",
